cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "risk-lab: One-day VaR and CVaR for a three-asset portfolio"
abstract: >-
  One-day Value at Risk and Conditional Value at Risk for a fixed
  three-asset portfolio of SPY, TLT and GLD, with a walk-forward backtest,
  Kupiec and Christoffersen coverage tests, a pre-registered comparison of
  historical, parametric, EWMA, GARCH(1,1) and adaptive-window models with
  Diebold-Mariano tests, and a dated fresh-data refresh that never overwrites
  the committed snapshot.
authors:
